---
import Landing from '../components/index/Landing.astro';
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import "../styles/global.css";
---

<Layout>
  <div class="w-full h-full flex flex-col justify-center items-center gap-2">
    <h1 class="text-white text-4xl font-mono">
      About
    </h1>
    <p class="text-text-primary font-sans">
      I enjoy <span class="text-white font-medium">cybersecurity</span> and everything <span class="text-white font-medium">low-level</span>. I'm exploring <span class="text-white font-medium">binary exploitation (pwn)</span> playing ctf with <a href="https://pwnissa.it" target="_blank" class="text-amber-200 underline">pwnissa</a>, focusing right now on kernel exploitation.
    </p>

    <p class="text-text-primary font-sans">
      Accademically, I'm pursuing a <span class="text-white font-medium">bachelor's degree in computer science</span> at the university of Genoa (Italy); in the meantime I work as <span class="text-white font-medium">fullstack dev</span>.
    </p>
  </div>
</Layout>